      "writtenOn": "2026-05-29T17:51:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. To completely avoid lock acquisition or iteration overhead in threadMain during normal operation, we introduced an atomic flag mHasCongestedConnections in EventThread. threadMain now performs a fast, lock-free check of this flag on every frame. The flag is set to true atomically when congestion occurs, and safely set back to false in threadMain only when all connection queues have been fully flushed.",
      "parentUuid": "258e44eb_c82bea1a",
      "revId": "0ebc75933b794102751931112b206be7730debb8",
